#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/aligned_alloc.3:40
msgid ""
"B<aligned_alloc>()  allocates I<size> bytes and returns a pointer to the "
"allocated memory.  The memory address will be a multiple of I<alignment>, "
"which must be a power of two.  This address can later be successfully passed "
"to B<free>(3)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/aligned_alloc.3:42 build/C/man3/posix_memalign.3:53
msgid "The memory is not zeroed."
msgstr ""

